ough Instagram Video.\n* Get inspired by photos and videos from new accounts in Explore.\n* Discover brands and small businesses, and shop products that are relevant to your personal style.\n\nExpress Yourself and Connect With Friends\n\n* Post photos and videos to your feed that you want to show on your profile.\n* Message your friends with Messenger. Share and connect over what you see on Feed and Stories.", "short_description": "Bringing you closer to the people and things you love. \u2014 Instagram from Facebook\n\nConnect with friends, share what you\u2019re up to, or see what's new from others all over the world. Explore our community where you can feel free to be yourself and share everything from your daily moments to life's highlights."}]}, "developer_name": "Instagram, Inc.", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://help.instagram.com/519522125107875", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://help.instagram.com/581066165581870", "publisher_name": "Instagram, Inc.", "support_website_url": "https://help.instagram.com/", "website_url": "https://www.instagram.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1228796255027646"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["SOCIAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["nn", "de", "hi", "fi", "kn", "ru", "sv", "ko", "pt", "nl_BE", "af", "bg", "mr", "ms", "el", "en", "hr", "pt_BR", "it", "bn", "fr", "hu", "ta", "es", "gu", "en_GB", "fr_CA", "pa", "te", "vi", "zh_TW", "nb", "en_US", "th", "zh_HK", "si", "uk", "ja", "ne", "sk", "tl", "id", "pl", "es_MX", "zh_CN", "da", "ro", "nl", "tr", "ml", "sr"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SI